---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { brand, contact } from '../data/site';
const crumbs = [{ name: 'Privacy', path: '/privacy' }];
const addr = contact.address.join(', ');
---
<Base title={`Privacy Policy at ${brand.legal}`} desc={`How ${brand.legal} collects, uses and looks after personal information sent through this website.`} crumbs={crumbs}>
  <PageHero title="Privacy Policy" crumbs={crumbs} />
  <section class="sec"><div class="wrap narrow legal">
    <p>This policy explains what personal information {brand.legal} collects through this website, why, and what your rights are under UK data protection law (the UK GDPR and the Data Protection Act 2018).</p>
    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>{brand.legal} (company registration number {brand.companyNo}) is the data controller. Our address is {addr}. You can contact us about your information on {contact.phone} or at <a class="link" href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>{contact.email}</a>.</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>We only collect what you choose to send us through the forms on this website:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Your name, company, telephone number and email address</li>
      <li>The trailer or service you are asking about, and anything you write in your message</li>
      <li>For part exchange and sale enquiries, the details you give about your own trailer, such as make, model, registration number and condition</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Why we use it</h2>
    <p>We use this information to reply to your enquiry, to give you a quotation or valuation, and to arrange a sale, purchase or service if you go ahead. Our lawful basis is our legitimate interest in answering enquiries and, where relevant, taking steps at your request before entering into a contract. We do not sell your information and we do not use it for marketing unless you ask us to.</p>
    <h2>Who handles it for us</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Web3Forms delivers the forms on this website to our email inbox.</li>
      <li>Vercel hosts this website and keeps standard server logs, such as IP address and browser type, to keep the site secure.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Both act as processors on our instructions. Some of this processing may take place outside the UK, protected by the safeguards UK law requires.</p>
    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>We keep enquiries for as long as we need to deal with them and for our normal business records. If you would like your information deleted sooner, tell us.</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>You can ask us for a copy of your information, ask us to correct or delete it, and object to or restrict how we use it. To do any of these, contact us using the details above. If you are unhappy with how we have handled your information you can complain to the Information Commissioner's Office at ico.org.uk or on 0303 123 1113.</p>
    <h2 id="cookies">Cookies</h2>
    <p>This website does not set advertising or analytics cookies. If that changes, we will ask for your consent first and update this page.</p>
    <p>Links to WhatsApp, Google and Facebook take you to those services, which have their own privacy policies.</p>
  </div></section>
</Base>
